@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@validBearerToken =
@missingClientIdBearerToken =

### UC08 listagem valida -> esperado: 200 OK
# @name listarAgendamentos
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedulings
Authorization: Bearer {{validBearerToken}}

### UC08 sem autenticacao -> esperado: 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedulings

### UC08 JWT sem clientId -> esperado: 403 Forbidden
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedulings
Authorization: Bearer {{missingClientIdBearerToken}}

### UC08 rota inexistente -> esperado: 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedulings/rota-inexistente
Authorization: Bearer {{validBearerToken}}
